      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Think of it this way; anything that does not say &quot;One-Shot&quot; stays on the field; this can include Ongoings, Equipment, Components, Relics, Modes, and many are combinations of such.&nbsp; Anything that destroys&nbsp;these will specify&nbsp;in the card text.&nbsp; If&nbsp;a villain card says &quot;destroy an Equipment Card&quot; or one of Omnitron-X&#39;s cards say &quot;Destroy a Component card&quot;, Omni-X&#39;s Innervation Ray can be destroyed by either as it&#39;s title is &quot;Equipment,&nbsp;Component&quot;.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any card that has Ongoing in the title can be destroyed by Ongoing destruction; anything with Equipment in the title can be destroyed by Equipment destruction.&nbsp; In the end, it all comes down to the text of the card.</p>",
